  "notes": "语言更简单，佣金钱包改名。\n\n- 语言只剩「简体中文」和「English」两个选项。原来选了「跟随系统」的，升级后会定在你当时看到的那门语言，不会突然变；想换随时去设置页选。\n- 「佣金」钱包改叫「现金钱包」，里面的字也跟着改成可用现金、可提现现金、现金提现。你赚到的还是佣金，只是这笔钱现在有了更好记的名字。\n",
  "notesEn": "Simpler language choice, and the commission wallet is now the cash wallet.\n\n- Interface language is now just Chinese (Simplified) or English. If you were on \"Follow system\", the app keeps showing the language you were already seeing and simply remembers it — nothing changes on screen, and it no longer shifts when you change an OS setting. Pick a different one any time in Settings.\n- The Commission wallet is now the Cash wallet: available cash, cash available to withdraw, transfer cash to balance, withdraw cash. What you earn is still called commission — only the name of the money itself changed.\n",
